Addenda:
Westmount-Square is architectural masterpiece drawn by Mies Van der Rohe is strategically located with direct indoor access to Westmount Square shopping mall with underground connection to Alexis Nihon Plaza & the metro. Also accessible from the building are various services, restaurants, medical clinics and other facilities.



The building also has the following perks crucial to upscale living:
- Beautiful ground floor terrace exclusively accessible to residents
- 24 hour valet service, doorman and security
- Travertine adorned lobby
- An indoor pool
- A Gym

Additional information:

ii.To be included in the lease:
- Lessees shall acknowledge that they are subtenants of the lessor pursuant to this sublease, under the Westmount Square legal structure.
- Pets to be approved by the landlord;
- Non smoking (cigarettes, cannabis or any other illicit substance);
- Tenant liability insurance required at the signing of the lease;
- Credit check required for approval;
- No Airbnb and no subletting allowed;

