Addenda:
CONDITIONS TO LEASE:

1- Lessee will provide a copy of employment and/or proof of income. Acceptance of promise to lease by the lessor, is subject to a pre-rental/credit verification. In case of a negative report, the promise to lease will be null and void; 

2- Lessee is informed that sub-leasing is not permitted, the condo is non-smoking and pets are not allowed; 

3- The lessor is not responsible for repairing damages or paying any penalties imposed by the building administration, that are caused by the tenant or the tenant's family and guests; 

4- The lessee is not allowed to do any aesthetic modifications of the premises; 

5- The Lessee is responsible to maintain the condo in a clean and habitable manner throughout the lease term. The condo must be in the same condition as prior to the occupation. The Lessee is responsible to clean the property prior to his departure, cleaning includes all kitchen appliances, washer/ dryer, and all floors shall be in the same condition as prior to occupation.

6- On or before moving, the lessee must provide liability insurance in the amount of 2 million dollars which must be valid for the duration of the lease as well as the Hydro account. Failure to provide a copy of the valid insurance and Hydro account will delay the moving date without any monetary compensation to the lessee; 

7- All costs requested by the building association, and is related to the move-in/out shall be at the lessee's expense; 

8- The Lessor and his management team have the right to periodically check the condition of the premises. 

9- Lessee will pay rent by e-transfer, or bank transfer;

